SOAP: SOAP clients and servers, with libxml2 of the package az and the
session persistence of SoapServer (php84-session).

The module soap of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20240924/soap.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d, its headers in
include/php84/php/ext/soap.
